{"ref":"BDB, אַמָּה²","hw":"אַמָּה²","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אַמָּה</span></big>  <strong>n.f.</strong> only <strong>mother-city</strong>, metropolis (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֵם²\" href=\"/BDB,_אֵם²\", dir=\"rtl\">אֵם</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:19\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.19\">2 S 20:19</a> & Ph.); in phrase <span dir=\"rtl\">מֶתֶג הָאַמָּה</span> <em>authority of mother-city</em> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:1\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.1\">2 S 8:1</a>; v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, מֶ֫תֶג\" href=\"/BDB,_מֶ֫תֶג\", dir=\"rtl\">מֶתֶג</a>; cf. Dr.","next":"BDB, אַמָּה³","prev":"BDB, אֵם²"}